---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const PROMOTE = '/promote/';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Submission received — We Are Founders Directory"
  description="Your tool submission has been received. Here's what happens next, and how to get more reach."
>
  <div class="container thanks">
    <section class="thanks__hero">
      <span class="thanks__check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <h1>You're in</h1>
      <p class="thanks__lede">
        Thanks for submitting your tool. We review every listing by hand to keep the
        directory useful, so yours will appear once it's been checked. You don't need
        to do anything else, we'll take it from here.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="thanks__upsell">
      <div class="thanks__upsell-head">
        <span class="thanks__eyebrow">Want to be seen first?</span>
        <h2>Boost your reach</h2>
        <p>
          Your listing is free and stays free. If you'd rather not wait, or you want
          real distribution, these packages move you to the front of the queue, put
          you at the top of your category, and get you an exclusive week in The Friday
          Brief. We open just 4 Spotlight slots a month.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="thanks__tiers">
        <div class="thanks__tier">
          <div class="thanks__tier-name">Spotlight</div>
          <div class="thanks__tier-price">$49</div>
          <div class="thanks__tier-desc">48-hour review, 30-day feature, and your own week in The Friday Brief. 4 slots a month</div>
        </div>
        <div class="thanks__tier thanks__tier--featured">
          <span class="thanks__tier-badge">Most popular</span>
          <div class="thanks__tier-name">Spotlight + Story</div>
          <div class="thanks__tier-price">$199</div>
          <div class="thanks__tier-desc">Featured, plus a full story and a dofollow link</div>
        </div>
        <div class="thanks__tier">
          <div class="thanks__tier-name">+ Brief</div>
          <div class="thanks__tier-price">$399</div>
          <div class="thanks__tier-desc">All of the above, plus the lead slot in The Friday Brief</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="thanks__cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href={PROMOTE}>See full packages →</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/">Back to the directory</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="thanks__badge">
      <div class="thanks__badge-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/badges/waf-badge-light.svg" alt="" width="220" height="54" />
      </div>
      <div class="thanks__badge-copy">
        <span class="thanks__eyebrow">Once you're live</span>
        <h2>You'll get a badge for your site</h2>
        <p>
          Every listed tool gets a "Listed on We Are Founders" badge, in light and
          dark, with a one-line snippet to drop on your site. We'll send it with the
          link to your listing once it's published.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .thanks { padding-block: 3rem 5rem; max-width: 760px; }

    .thanks__hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .thanks__check {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--waf-accent);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .thanks__hero h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .thanks__lede {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 52ch;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .thanks__upsell {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
    }
    .thanks__upsell-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .thanks__eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--waf-accent);
    }
    .thanks__upsell-head h2 { margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem; font-size: 1.75rem; }
    .thanks__upsell-head p {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 56ch;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .thanks__tiers {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .thanks__tiers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .thanks__tier {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.25rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .thanks__tier--featured {
      border-color: var(--waf-accent);
      border-width: 2px;
      background: var(--waf-accent-soft);
    }
    .thanks__tier-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -0.6rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--waf-accent);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.625rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .thanks__tier-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .thanks__tier-price {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .thanks__tier-desc {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }


    .thanks__badge {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      background: var(--bg-elevated);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .thanks__badge {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }
    }
    .thanks__badge-art img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }
    .thanks__badge-copy h2 {
      margin: 0.4rem 0 0.6rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    .thanks__badge-copy p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .thanks__cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
